'''Love''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by collecting 200 [[Hearts (Currency)|Hearts]] {{Currency|Heart}} during the [[Valentines Event 2023|2023 Valentines Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is reddish pink in color with a slight gradient with five red heart balloons imprinted on it, varying in different sizes. The guard is a slightly lighter shade or pink, and the guard is solid black.
